  <h2>Current direction</h2>
  <p>The project is prioritizing a usable public product surface: native documentation, developer onboarding, a clear mode contract, and honest release boundaries.</p>
  <h2>Recent engineering work</h2>
  <ul><li>Canonicalized the public API around <code>basic</code> and <code>multilevel</code>.</li><li>Added atomic refresh validation and rollback-safe state exposure.</li><li>Hardened recursive schedules, graph identity, and deferred deletion checks.</li><li>Expanded deterministic and property-based verification.</li></ul>
